    "destination effect cardinality",
    "decision conformance",
    "durable denial coverage"
  ],
  "timing": "Descriptive wall time for each execute call; includes OPA CLI startup and LangGraph checkpoint/interrupt overhead; not normalized engine latency or human approval time.",
